<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50679" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππαρχ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ruling the horse</i>, epith. of
			Poseidon, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>commander of cavalry</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἵππου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.154
				</span></i>
			; at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.116.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				799
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				16.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				755c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				880d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵ. εἰς Λῆμνον χειροτονεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.26
			</span></i>; in other states, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.2466
			</span></i> (Thebes, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc.; in the Achaean
			league, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(2).344.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Orchomenus</span>), etc.; =
			Lat. <i>magister equitum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, etc.; =
			<i>praefectus equitum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				47
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππάρχης</span>.</div>
